  <informations>Unofficial simplified front illustration redrawn from official MDT photograph https://www.mdt.de/fileadmin/user_upload/_processed_/5/9/csm_SCN-RT8REG-02_F_6773147826.png. Clear native regular Arial text, not pixel-traced lettering. This is an approximate layout, not a dimensionally/detail-exact manufacturer CAD conversion; pin details omitted. Front nominal envelope 36 x 90 mm, 2 drawing units/mm. No electrical connection terminals. Product source: https://www.mdt.de/produkte/produktdetail/temperaturregler-8-fach.html</informations>
